# This repository is a Python project that happens to contain a static site.
# Vercel detects the runtime from files in the root, so requirements.txt made
# it build as Python and fail with "No python entrypoint found" -- it never
# reached the static files at all. Keeping the Python markers out of the
# upload is what makes it a static deployment; vercel.json blanking
# buildCommand and installCommand is the second line of defence.
requirements.txt
pyproject.toml
setup.py
setup.cfg
Pipfile
conftest.py
*.py

# Large or irrelevant to the site. .venv alone is 994 MB and results/ is
# 127 MB; the figures the site shows are already embedded in the HTML.
.venv
.git
__pycache__
node_modules
results
data
src
experiments
tools
tests
docs
prototypes
*.csv
*.pptx
